  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad79e9629deb2e47d874b/step-46edca00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice Asian greens into quarters lengthways.\n• Thinly slice carrot into sticks.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, the honey, soy sauce and water (for the sauce).\n• In a small bowl, combine sriracha (add less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad79e9629deb2e47d874b/step-3159bd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a microwave-safe bowl, add carrot, Asian greens and a splash of water, then cover with a damp paper towel.\n• Microwave veggies on high until just tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then season with salt and pepper. Cover to keep warm.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Add honey-soy mixture and veggies, tossing until well combined, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad79e9629deb2e47d874b/step-c6676420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, tofu and veggies between bowls.\n• Drizzle with sriracha mayo to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad79e9629deb2e47d874b/step-25230430.jpg"
    }
  ]
